Sample datasets bundled with PyCol (doc branch).

Numerical features, no missing values; binary and multi-class problems.
Used in the upstream README usage example:

  complexity = Complexity("dataset/61_iris.arff", ...)

See Metric Reference → Sample datasets in the Dataset Complexity app to load these into comparison runs.

Source: https://github.com/miriamspsantos/pycol/tree/doc/dataset
